                            <comment id="463166" author="adilger" created="Wed, 9 Jul 2025 20:24:17 +0000">&lt;p&gt;This is already possible with "&lt;tt&gt;&amp;#45;n|&amp;#45;&amp;#45;no&amp;#45;name&lt;/tt&gt;" to match "&lt;tt&gt;lctl get_param&lt;/tt&gt;" but this option name is non-intuitive for users.  &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Adding a "&lt;tt&gt;&amp;#45;q|&amp;#45;&amp;#45;quiet&lt;/tt&gt;" alias would make this more clear.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
